{"id":"266bdc015ee47b22","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-analytic-set.md","title":"ZFC Analytic Set","display":"df-zfc-analytic-set — ZFC Analytic Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-analytic-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-analytic-set"],"display":"df-zfc-analytic-set — ZFC Analytic Set","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-borel-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-analytic-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-analytic-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-analytic-set — ZFC Analytic Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dedfc8e5804658ad\" href=\"?note=dedfc8e5804658ad\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-borel-set\">../batch14/58-df-borel-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\tau_{\\mathcal N^2}\\in V\">\\(A,\\tau_{\\mathcal N^2}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathcal N^2}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathcal N^2}\\)</span> is the canonical product topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^\\omega\\times\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\omega^\\omega\\times\\omega^\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Borel}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> is the Borel-set predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dedfc8e5804658ad\" href=\"?note=dedfc8e5804658ad\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-borel-set.md\">../batch14/58-df-borel-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AnalyticSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{AnalyticSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AnalyticSet}_S(A)\n\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\n\\land\\exists B\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\times\\omega^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Borel}_S(B,\\omega^\\omega\\times\\omega^\\omega,\\tau_{\\mathcal N^2})\n\\land A=\\{x\\in\\omega^\\omega:\\exists y\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in B)\\}\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AnalyticSet}_S(A)\n\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\n\\land\\exists B\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\times\\omega^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Borel}_S(B,\\omega^\\omega\\times\\omega^\\omega,\\tau_{\\mathcal N^2})\n\\land A=\\{x\\in\\omega^\\omega:\\exists y\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in B)\\}\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li>The ambient topology is fixed, and the assertion calls the registered three-place Borel predicate with its exact signature.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-borel-set","status":"resolved","id":"dedfc8e5804658ad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-borel-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-borel-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"dedfc8e5804658ad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Borel}_S\\subseteq V^3$ is the Borel-set predicate (see [[../batch14/58-df-borel-set.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,\\tau_{\\mathcal N^2}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathcal N^2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^\\omega\\times\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Borel}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AnalyticSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AnalyticSet}_S(A)\n\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\n\\land\\exists B\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\times\\omega^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Borel}_S(B,\\omega^\\omega\\times\\omega^\\omega,\\tau_{\\mathcal N^2})\n\\land A=\\{x\\in\\omega^\\omega:\\exists y\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in B)\\}\n\\Bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1152,"backlinks":[{"id":"9331b22006d4e290","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AnalyticSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (analytic-set predicate on Baire space, see [[../batch08/58-df-zfc-analytic-set.md]])"},{"id":"5a99f1813d80f3c2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AnalyticSet}_S$ (analytic-set predicate, see [[../batch08/58-df-zfc-analytic-set.md]])"},{"id":"603d99181a787aba","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\in V$，$\\mathrm{AnalyticSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$（see [[../batch08/58-df-zfc-analytic-set.md]]）"},{"id":"f3816129af6366c4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AnalyticSet}_S\\subseteq V$ (analytic subset of $\\omega^\\omega$, see [[../batch08/58-df-zfc-analytic-set.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1458","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-analytic-set.md|58-df-zfc-analytic-set]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","dedfc8e5804658ad"]}